segment.source:
I had to go through a few idiots hittin' on her, easy-peasy, but there was this one guy who was pretty damn stubborn. 

*This* guy. 

So, I wanted 'er bad, he wanted 'er bad - ya fuel that with lotsa brew and the next moment we're outside dukin' it out.&lt;end&gt;

